WEBVTT

00:08.800 --> 00:11.420
<b>I'm useless. A complete failure.</b>

00:12.130 --> 00:14.010
<b>I'm a complete failure!</b>

00:14.720 --> 00:16.470
<b>This is it!</b>

00:17.970 --> 00:22.390
<b>This is the last time!</b>

00:27.230 --> 00:28.730
<b>Hey, Chugo?</b>

00:28.900 --> 00:30.990
<b>You mentioned that this was the "last time."</b>

00:31.150 --> 00:33.530
<b>What was that all about?</b>

00:36.070 --> 00:39.450
<b>This is the last time I'm going to see you.</b>

00:39.700 --> 00:41.500
<b>Wait.</b>

00:42.000 --> 00:43.160
<b>Can it be?</b>

00:43.910 --> 00:48.170
<b>Did you run out of money?</b>

01:55.280 --> 01:58.820
<b>Yanaka, Iroha Tea House</b>

02:08.290 --> 02:11.290
<b>It's the doing of Shugoro of Hakabi.</b>

02:13.050 --> 02:15.880
<b>-Are you sure?
-I've no doubt.</b>

02:16.380 --> 02:19.510
<b>The five-story pagoda found near the dead bodies</b>

02:19.680 --> 02:21.640
<b>proves that it was his doing.</b>

02:22.180 --> 02:24.680
<b>Shugoro of Hakabi,</b>

02:24.850 --> 02:26.770
<b>what a nuisance.</b>

02:29.440 --> 02:32.060
<b>Starting today, we'll strengthen our patrol in the city.</b>

02:32.230 --> 02:33.610
<b>Proceed with the arrangements.</b>

02:34.400 --> 02:35.900
<b>Kimura.</b>

02:36.070 --> 02:37.610
<b>Chugo, this applies to you too.</b>

02:39.320 --> 02:41.530
<b>M--? Me too?</b>

02:41.700 --> 02:44.990
<b>Chief, you can't be serious.</b>

02:45.160 --> 02:47.540
<b>Usa-Chu's incompetent for the job.</b>

02:47.710 --> 02:50.040
<b>Did you just call him Usa-Chu?</b>

02:50.210 --> 02:54.130
<b>Well, there's a confections shop called Matsumura
near Shibashinmei Shrine,</b>

02:54.300 --> 02:57.760
<b>and they started selling
these things called Usagi Buns</b>

02:57.920 --> 03:00.970
<b>that resemble Kimura very much.</b>

03:01.140 --> 03:02.260
<b>Before we knew it...</b>

03:03.510 --> 03:06.430
<b>Kimura, why don't you stand up for yourself?</b>

03:06.600 --> 03:11.980
<b>Take a break from documenting,
man up and prove them wrong.</b>

03:15.270 --> 03:16.980
<b>Yes.</b>

03:19.320 --> 03:24.950
<b>Such being the case, I was stationed to patrol
the Ueno and Yanaka area, but...</b>

03:40.840 --> 03:42.550
<b>My name is Omatsu.</b>

03:42.720 --> 03:45.180
<b>Please, take care of me.</b>

03:53.190 --> 03:54.440
<b>How adorable!</b>

03:54.610 --> 03:57.190
<b>Hey, you're moving too fast for me!</b>

03:57.360 --> 03:59.900
<b>If a customer's my type, I can't help it!</b>

04:00.530 --> 04:02.950
<b>Tell me your name, Mr. Samurai.</b>

04:03.110 --> 04:07.740
<b>It's Chugo.
I'm a ronin from Ueda in Shinano.</b>

04:07.910 --> 04:10.620
<b>Chugo. Chugo.</b>

04:18.050 --> 04:19.510
<b>Welcome!</b>

04:21.090 --> 04:23.220
<b>Welcome!</b>

04:23.430 --> 04:24.760
<b>Welcome!</b>

04:24.930 --> 04:26.890
<b>Welcome! Welcome!</b>

04:27.350 --> 04:30.720
<b>Welcome! Welcome! Welcome!</b>

04:31.640 --> 04:36.270
<b>Next thing you know, you're completely broke.</b>

04:36.440 --> 04:39.780
<b>I even used up all the money my father left me.</b>

04:39.940 --> 04:43.780
<b>I've borrowed all the money I can from my relatives.</b>

04:43.950 --> 04:46.120
<b>I've got nothing now.</b>

04:46.990 --> 04:49.120
<b>Chugo.</b>

04:51.830 --> 04:53.960
<b>Forgive me, Chugo.</b>

04:54.120 --> 04:56.130
<b>I was tactless.</b>

04:56.790 --> 05:00.670
<b>Couldn't leave you with much.</b>

05:00.840 --> 05:07.640
<b>You got your naively honest nature from me,
your father.</b>

05:08.680 --> 05:10.310
<b>Listen to me.</b>

05:10.470 --> 05:12.270
<b>Live honestly.</b>

05:12.430 --> 05:16.310
<b>Always live honestly.</b>

05:17.690 --> 05:19.440
<b>Father.</b>

05:19.610 --> 05:21.650
<b>Father!</b>

05:22.820 --> 05:26.860
<b>Father, I'm terribly sorry.</b>

05:27.990 --> 05:29.990
<b>Chugo.</b>

05:31.240 --> 05:32.620
<b>Hey, stop that.</b>

05:32.790 --> 05:35.750
<b>Were you even listening?</b>

05:36.040 --> 05:40.420
<b>I'm just flattered to hear how you've gone
out of your way just to see me.</b>

05:40.590 --> 05:42.000
<b>No.</b>

05:42.170 --> 05:43.960
<b>That's not the point.</b>

05:44.420 --> 05:45.670
<b>I understand.</b>

05:45.840 --> 05:48.140
<b>Don't worry about the money.</b>

05:48.300 --> 05:51.470
<b>I can take care of the bill here.</b>

05:55.350 --> 05:56.890
<b>What? How?</b>

05:57.060 --> 06:00.770
<b>There's a customer who's willing to support us.</b>

06:00.940 --> 06:03.230
<b>You've got nothing to worry about.</b>

06:03.400 --> 06:05.990
<b>So, please, love me one more time.</b>

06:06.150 --> 06:08.910
<b>-Really?
-I want you to love me.</b>

06:09.070 --> 06:11.870
<b>H-- Hey, that's not the point here.</b>

06:15.450 --> 06:17.040
<b>Usa-Chu.</b>

06:17.210 --> 06:19.170
<b>Is it just me or is he acting strange?</b>

06:19.330 --> 06:23.880
<b>Yes. I'd say he's improved quite drastically.</b>

06:24.800 --> 06:29.550
<b>Being transferred to patrol from documenting
completely changed him.</b>

06:29.720 --> 06:34.100
<b>There's a glow in his complexion
and he's full of spirit.</b>

06:34.260 --> 06:37.980
<b>He puts the Usagi-Buns to shame.</b>

06:38.560 --> 06:40.190
<b>Hey, chief.</b>

06:40.350 --> 06:41.980
<b>What's going on?</b>

06:46.530 --> 06:48.530
<b>Call Kumehachi.</b>

06:52.870 --> 06:57.120
<b>How are things with that ronin you're into?</b>

06:57.540 --> 07:01.040
<b>Thanks to you, he visits me quite often.</b>

07:01.210 --> 07:04.290
<b>But why, Master Kawagoe?</b>

07:04.920 --> 07:08.510
<b>Why would you give me
such a large amount of money?</b>

07:08.670 --> 07:14.050
<b>Of course your ronin must be strapped for cash.</b>

07:14.720 --> 07:19.560
<b>He hasn't ordered any sake or appetizers these days.
I can't overlook that.</b>

07:20.140 --> 07:22.060
<b>But even then...</b>

07:23.400 --> 07:26.980
<b>Stop, I'm not that age anymore.</b>

07:27.820 --> 07:32.200
<b>I'm fully content just being able
to spend time with you like this.</b>

07:32.360 --> 07:33.990
<b>You're a strange man.</b>

07:34.160 --> 07:35.990
<b>Not really.</b>

07:37.290 --> 07:41.960
<b>Humans, we can engage in evil while doing good.</b>

07:42.120 --> 07:47.380
<b>At times, we engage in the good while doing evil
without intending to.</b>

07:47.550 --> 07:50.380
<b>Such is life.</b>

07:50.720 --> 07:52.800
<b>Master Kawagoe, an evil person?</b>

07:52.970 --> 07:54.050
<b>Don't make me laugh.</b>

07:54.220 --> 07:58.600
<b>Business won't function properly
without doing some evil.</b>

07:58.770 --> 08:03.850
<b>By the way,
I will be returning to Kawagoe soon.</b>

08:04.020 --> 08:06.610
<b>You won't find me in Edo for a while.</b>

08:06.770 --> 08:09.400
<b>Make sure to take care of that ronin,</b>

08:09.940 --> 08:11.780
<b>Omatsu.</b>

08:14.110 --> 08:16.410
<b>That's what Master Kawagoe said?</b>

08:17.160 --> 08:21.040
<b>I wanted you to meet him eventually.</b>

08:21.200 --> 08:23.830
<b>But there's a chance he may not come back.</b>

08:24.000 --> 08:25.540
<b>I see.</b>

08:25.920 --> 08:30.420
<b>I would've loved to express my gratitude
for what he's done for us.</b>

08:32.010 --> 08:35.220
<b>Engage in evil while doing good,</b>

08:35.390 --> 08:39.310
<b>and engage in good while doing evil, huh?</b>

08:39.470 --> 08:42.680
<b>How profound. Extremely profound.</b>

08:42.850 --> 08:44.850
<b>I don't understand it at all.</b>

08:45.020 --> 08:47.020
<b>It's a wise saying.</b>

08:47.190 --> 08:50.110
<b>Master Kawagoe is a master of life.</b>

08:50.280 --> 08:52.400
<b>I respect his word.</b>

08:55.030 --> 08:56.870
<b>You fool!</b>

08:57.030 --> 09:01.620
<b>Of all the times you choose to go to the brothel,
while you're on patrol duty?</b>

09:01.790 --> 09:03.580
<b>You're a disgrace to us samurai!</b>

09:03.750 --> 09:05.620
<b>A disgrace to the Arson Theft Control!</b>

09:06.830 --> 09:08.210
<b>I'm terribly sorry!</b>

09:08.380 --> 09:14.090
<b>I should've known something was up
with your change of character.</b>

09:14.260 --> 09:15.680
<b>You're a wastrel!</b>

09:15.840 --> 09:17.470
<b>A deadbeat!</b>

09:18.050 --> 09:21.100
<b>Never dare raise that head up for the rest of your life!</b>

09:21.260 --> 09:23.560
<b>That's enough, Sajima.</b>

09:23.730 --> 09:25.520
<b>Yes.</b>

09:25.940 --> 09:28.190
<b>Hey, Usa-Chu.</b>

09:28.770 --> 09:31.980
<b>Indeed, I did tell you to man up.</b>

09:32.150 --> 09:36.660
<b>But there seems to be a misunderstanding.</b>

09:37.320 --> 09:40.120
<b>For the meantime, you're on office duty.</b>

09:40.280 --> 09:41.740
<b>Understood!</b>

09:55.300 --> 09:57.510
<b>Excuse me.</b>

09:57.720 --> 10:00.300
<b>Hello there, Master Kawagoe.</b>

10:00.470 --> 10:02.390
<b>Please, come in.</b>

10:02.560 --> 10:04.770
<b>-Watch the shop, Sadahachi.
-Yes, sir.</b>

10:06.600 --> 10:09.560
<b>Please, have some tea.</b>

10:10.980 --> 10:14.990
<b>-What's this?
-It's a popular snack these days.</b>

10:19.950 --> 10:22.620
<b>How are the arrangements moving along?</b>

10:22.780 --> 10:25.500
<b>Everything is perfect.</b>

10:26.580 --> 10:29.460
<b>This is our last job in Edo.</b>

10:29.620 --> 10:32.380
<b>It's going to be a quick one.</b>

10:32.540 --> 10:36.260
<b>I have a bigger job waiting for me in Sendai.</b>

10:36.420 --> 10:38.300
<b>I understand.</b>

10:38.470 --> 10:41.090
<b>So, boss, how about the girl?</b>

10:42.680 --> 10:44.640
<b>You know who I'm talking about.</b>

10:44.810 --> 10:50.100
<b>You've been going to a place
a government official could easily control.</b>

10:50.270 --> 10:53.020
<b>We're the ones who are nervous about that.</b>

10:54.780 --> 10:57.360
<b>Hey, Otokichi,</b>

10:57.650 --> 11:00.570
<b>remember a woman named Oshizu?</b>

11:00.740 --> 11:01.740
<b>Yes.</b>

11:02.570 --> 11:03.910
<b>I remember her.</b>

11:04.790 --> 11:07.040
<b>But that was 20 years ago.</b>

11:08.410 --> 11:13.040
<b>There's a girl there who looks and acts just like her.</b>

11:13.210 --> 11:16.670
<b>I'm not there for her body.</b>

11:16.840 --> 11:20.720
<b>But she's been treating me very cordially,</b>

11:20.880 --> 11:23.600
<b>so I've been enjoying her company.</b>

11:23.890 --> 11:25.890
<b>Geez, boss.</b>

11:29.430 --> 11:32.730
<b>Excuse me. It's a delivery.</b>

11:35.440 --> 11:38.240
<b>Well, there's no need to worry.
I've got it under control.</b>

11:38.400 --> 11:44.830
<b>After all, I am the notorious Shugoro of Hakabi,
known among my peers for my cruel work.</b>

11:46.580 --> 11:48.790
<b>Warn everyone</b>

11:49.330 --> 11:54.790
<b>that we'll be seeing a lot of blood in this next job.</b>

11:59.460 --> 12:03.550
<b>Is it just me, or is Usa-Chu acting strange lately?</b>

12:03.720 --> 12:07.100
<b>His spirits from last week have completely vanished.</b>

12:08.310 --> 12:10.390
<b>He looks like death.</b>

12:10.560 --> 12:12.940
<b>Can't be teasing him like that.</b>

12:13.100 --> 12:15.650
<b>They say rabbits die of loneliness.</b>

12:15.810 --> 12:18.860
<b>Something must've happened
to make him feel like that.</b>

12:19.280 --> 12:20.780
<b>Oh, chief.</b>

12:20.940 --> 12:22.860
<b>What's the matter?</b>

12:33.000 --> 12:35.420
<b>I'm so lonely.</b>

12:35.920 --> 12:38.840
<b>I'm so lonely.</b>

12:39.340 --> 12:41.210
<b>Omatsu!</b>

12:43.550 --> 12:46.550
<b>-Did you hear that?
-Yeah.</b>

12:48.560 --> 12:51.770
<b>Excuse me. Thank you for your service.</b>

12:51.930 --> 12:55.900
<b>I didn't hear anything, did you?</b>

12:56.060 --> 12:58.400
<b>N-- No. Nothing in particular.</b>

12:58.610 --> 12:59.650
<b>Good.</b>

12:59.820 --> 13:01.360
<b>Stay awake.</b>

13:04.240 --> 13:07.660
<b>That's what I call, Arson Theft Control magic.</b>

13:07.820 --> 13:10.490
<b>Thanks to you, lantern.</b>

13:15.040 --> 13:17.250
<b>I'm all set.</b>

13:17.420 --> 13:19.590
<b>Omatsu, here I come!</b>

13:23.840 --> 13:29.890
<b>That's right.
I should hide this so they don't know who I am.</b>

13:35.230 --> 13:37.350
<b>I didn't see anything.</b>

13:37.520 --> 13:40.070
<b>Omatsu, I'm coming for you.</b>

13:42.400 --> 13:47.570
<b>You got your naively honest nature from me,
your father.</b>

13:48.490 --> 13:50.120
<b>Listen to me.</b>

13:50.280 --> 13:55.330
<b>Live honestly. Always live honestly.</b>

13:57.080 --> 14:02.250
<b>Father, why are you telling me that now?</b>

14:03.260 --> 14:05.090
<b>Darn it!</b>

14:10.050 --> 14:11.850
<b>-Where's boss?
-He's not here yet.</b>

14:12.010 --> 14:14.270
<b>You're the fourth out of eight.</b>

14:17.640 --> 14:23.020
<b>This is bad.
They're going to ambush the place now.</b>

14:29.700 --> 14:31.870
<b>Yup, I can see it all.</b>

14:32.030 --> 14:34.370
<b>Sorry to bother you this late.</b>

14:34.540 --> 14:36.620
<b>I'm glad to help.</b>

14:36.790 --> 14:38.960
<b>Can I ask another favor?</b>

14:39.120 --> 14:42.590
<b>Will you take that lantern
back to the public office in Shimizumon</b>

14:42.750 --> 14:45.510
<b>and report to them about this situation?</b>

14:46.720 --> 14:48.760
<b>-Go on.
-Yes.</b>

14:54.720 --> 14:56.100
<b>That's the fifth one.</b>

14:56.930 --> 14:58.810
<b>Seven more to go.</b>

14:58.980 --> 15:01.350
<b>I'm not missing anyone.</b>

15:07.860 --> 15:09.860
<b>What's the current count?</b>

15:10.030 --> 15:12.370
<b>It's written right there.</b>

15:14.160 --> 15:16.370
<b>Chief!</b>

15:16.870 --> 15:18.250
<b>Eleven, eh?</b>

15:18.410 --> 15:20.960
<b>-One more to go.
-Y-- Yes.</b>

15:21.880 --> 15:24.750
<b>This is their hideout.</b>

15:24.920 --> 15:25.960
<b>Yes.</b>

15:26.130 --> 15:30.720
<b>At any rate, I'm impressed
that you're patrolling this late at night.</b>

15:30.880 --> 15:33.300
<b>-Well done.
-Well...</b>

15:33.470 --> 15:34.470
<b>It's admirable.</b>

15:35.180 --> 15:37.850
<b>I second that.</b>

15:39.100 --> 15:40.600
<b>Hey.</b>

15:48.530 --> 15:49.780
<b>Get into your positions.</b>

15:49.940 --> 15:52.910
<b>Chugo, guard the entrance from the outside.</b>

15:53.070 --> 15:56.700
<b>If we miss any of them and they escape,
slay them at once.</b>

15:57.410 --> 15:58.700
<b>Yes.</b>

16:07.130 --> 16:10.510
<b>This is Heizo Hasegawa of Arson Theft Control!</b>

16:10.670 --> 16:12.220
<b>Comply with our commands!</b>

16:42.830 --> 16:44.540
<b>Surrender now!</b>

16:49.340 --> 16:50.800
<b>You little brat!</b>

17:13.610 --> 17:17.570
<b>Omatsu.</b>

17:28.790 --> 17:30.590
<b>Hey, Chugo.</b>

17:32.630 --> 17:34.380
<b>Are you all right?</b>

17:34.760 --> 17:36.010
<b>Yes.</b>

17:39.010 --> 17:41.180
<b>That thief you killed,</b>

17:41.850 --> 17:44.930
<b>-that was Shugoro of Hakabi.
-What?</b>

17:45.100 --> 17:49.060
<b>We found a five-story pagoda figure by his side.</b>

17:49.230 --> 17:50.940
<b>What a glorious achievement.</b>

17:51.900 --> 17:53.940
<b>This is a reward from me.</b>

17:55.740 --> 17:58.780
<b>Take it. There's no need to hesitate.</b>

17:59.570 --> 18:01.200
<b>I cannot accept that.</b>

18:02.120 --> 18:04.080
<b>Why is that?</b>

18:04.950 --> 18:07.790
<b>Chief, I must confess.</b>

18:07.960 --> 18:11.380
<b>I wasn't on patrol that night.</b>

18:11.540 --> 18:16.340
<b>I snuck out of the row house
to visit the girl at the brothel.</b>

18:16.510 --> 18:20.430
<b>I'm... I'm terribly sorry!</b>

18:23.890 --> 18:25.270
<b>Usa-Chu,</b>

18:25.770 --> 18:27.850
<b>you don't have to be that tense.</b>

18:28.020 --> 18:31.980
<b>We all need to take a break in order to work hard.</b>

18:32.150 --> 18:35.320
<b>We might give into evil
while doing good at times.</b>

18:36.190 --> 18:41.160
<b>At times, we do good while engaging in evil
without intending to.</b>

18:41.490 --> 18:44.200
<b>Such is life.</b>

18:45.910 --> 18:47.750
<b>What's the matter?</b>

18:48.120 --> 18:49.920
<b>Nothing.</b>

18:51.210 --> 18:53.040
<b>I'm a bit tired.</b>

18:53.210 --> 18:55.420
<b>Massage my shoulders, will you?</b>

18:56.970 --> 18:58.420
<b>Of course.</b>

19:01.970 --> 19:03.470
<b>That's perfect.</b>

19:03.640 --> 19:05.310
<b>You're good at this.</b>

19:05.470 --> 19:08.810
<b>I used to massage
my late father's shoulders quite often.</b>

19:11.060 --> 19:15.980
<b>Your father passed away six years ago, right?</b>

19:16.150 --> 19:21.820
<b>I heard he was devoted to his duties
and had a warm personality.</b>

19:23.070 --> 19:27.620
<b>He was there before I joined the office,
so I'm not even familiar with his face.</b>

19:35.590 --> 19:37.670
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

19:40.510 --> 19:45.680
<b>By the way, I know this is sudden news,
but that brothel will close its doors today.</b>

19:47.060 --> 19:50.310
<b>Mr. Shirakawa has always been fussy about it.</b>

19:51.560 --> 19:54.980
<b>Saying that it's outrageous to have a brothel</b>

19:55.150 --> 19:58.570
<b>so close to the shogunate's family temple.</b>

19:59.940 --> 20:02.660
<b>It's not too late yet.</b>

20:05.450 --> 20:08.950
<b>I gratefully accept the 3 ryo.</b>

20:09.160 --> 20:14.960
<b>This will be a farewell gift for Omatsu,
the girl at the brothel,</b>

20:15.130 --> 20:17.840
<b>and to severe myself from the past.</b>

20:21.090 --> 20:23.590
<b>"Iroha Tea House"</b>

20:30.770 --> 20:32.770
<b>-Hello there, Chugo.
-Ma'am.</b>

20:32.940 --> 20:36.610
<b>I apologize for the sudden news.</b>

20:36.770 --> 20:38.900
<b>You're here for Omatsu, right?</b>

20:39.070 --> 20:41.110
<b>She moved to Yoshiwara.</b>

20:41.320 --> 20:45.490
<b>It's a place called Hishiya. She's waiting for you there.</b>

20:45.950 --> 20:48.910
<b>Chugo, look that way for a second.</b>

20:49.080 --> 20:50.160
<b>Just do it.</b>

20:51.580 --> 20:54.250
<b>You look just like your father!</b>

20:54.920 --> 20:58.040
<b>You're being distant.
You said that you're a ronin of Shinano.</b>

20:58.210 --> 21:01.920
<b>If you told me your name,
I would've taken care of you from the start.</b>

21:02.420 --> 21:05.550
<b>Actually, Mr. Hasegawa showed up yesterday.</b>

21:05.720 --> 21:10.470
<b>He insisted to pay for his subordinate's tab.
I asked if he was talking about you, the ronin,</b>

21:10.640 --> 21:14.390
<b>but it struck me as soon as he said your name,
Chugo Kimura.</b>

21:15.690 --> 21:17.730
<b>"Can he be Yoshiyuki Kimura's son?"</b>

21:17.900 --> 21:21.230
<b>It took me by surprise.</b>

21:21.400 --> 21:24.400
<b>Your father used to be my customer.</b>

21:24.900 --> 21:27.160
<b>He took care of me quite a bit.</b>

21:27.820 --> 21:32.790
<b>I'm sure things were tight at home,
but he still managed to pay for my services.</b>

21:33.200 --> 21:35.420
<b>He was great in many ways.</b>

21:35.580 --> 21:39.790
<b>Must be some kind of fate
for Omatsu to favor you too, don't you think?</b>

21:40.170 --> 21:43.510
<b>So long, Chugo. Be well.</b>

21:50.850 --> 21:54.680
<b>Honestly. Always live honestly.</b>

21:55.480 --> 21:57.900
<b>Damn it.</b>

21:58.060 --> 22:01.440
<b>Father, how could you?</b>

22:01.940 --> 22:03.610
<b>Wait for me, Omatsu.</b>

22:03.780 --> 22:07.240
<b>I'm coming right now!</b>

22:21.130 --> 22:27.300
<b>People are creatures born from dreams</b>

22:27.470 --> 22:33.140
<b>How can the sky look so blue?</b>

22:33.310 --> 22:39.100
<b>The past and future are just short-lived moments</b>

22:39.440 --> 22:44.860
<b>that exist between the blink of an eye</b>

22:47.820 --> 22:50.110
<b>Oh time…</b>

22:50.280 --> 22:54.120
<b>I could be a flower of spring</b>

22:54.290 --> 22:59.170
<b>in my next life</b>

23:00.040 --> 23:05.130
<b>And then…live on</b>

23:05.960 --> 23:11.340
<b>…and then…be loved</b>

23:12.050 --> 23:14.970
<b>La la la</b>

23:20.230 --> 23:23.610
<b>And then…cry</b>

23:26.980 --> 23:32.990
<b>…and then…fall</b>

23:40.040 --> 23:41.210
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:41.540 --> 23:43.960
<b>Heizou encounters a mysterious man
during a journey.</b>

23:44.460 --> 23:48.050
<b>That man offered a theft job to Heizou.</b>

23:49.220 --> 23:51.630
<b>Next on Onihei, "Secret Theft Tactics."</b>

23:51.800 --> 23:55.010
<b>"Secret Theft Tactics"</b>
